lemuri (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Files view: this computer and the server side by side over a terminal.
  * Launch groups and folders open several servers split in one tab.
  * Recent servers: a button under the ghost and Ctrl+Shift+O.
  * Ghost mode has the files view and the Team page.
  * Team page opens with the master password, and is simpler.
  * A band over every terminal; slimmer scroll bars; rounded menus.
  * The app icon and the splash screen in the app's dark green.

 -- Lemuri contributors <noreply@getlemuri.github.io>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0000

lemuri (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The new texts show at the first start after an update.
  * No crash when a terminal scrolled back grows taller.
  * Ghost mode no longer stuck when maximized on a screen without panels.

